    "body": "newTrackon is not a normal bitTorrent client, it's supposed to show the canonical hostname for trackers. Also, AFAIK following redirects means any person could create any HTTP server and redirect it to a different tracker. I've been looking at the code considering this, and realized that newTrackon could be following HTTP redirects in some scenario. Will disable them now.",
